      "id": "1998-01-05-sonny-bono-death",
      "date": "1998-01-05",
      "topic": "deaths",
      "text": "5 January saw American pop icon and Republican congressman **Sonny Bono** die at the age of 62 after colliding with a tree while skiing in Lake Tahoe. Rising to international fame alongside former wife Cher with 1960s anthems like *I Got You Babe*, Bono had pulled off the remarkably improbable transition from bell-bottomed pop star to respected Capitol Hill politician. Fellow politicians praised his self-deprecating wit, admitting they had rarely met a legislator who took his work so seriously and his own ego so lightly.",
