      "text": "18 January saw **\"Stone Cold\" Steve Austin** win the 30-man Royal Rumble match in San Jose, California, punching his ticket to the main event of *WrestleMania XIV*. Austin last eliminated rising rival The Rock, while Mick Foley set a bizarre longevity record by entering the match three separate times under his various personas of Cactus Jack, Chainsaw Charlie and Mankind. Up in a private luxury box, suspended heavyweight boxer **Mike Tyson** applauded the mayhem, setting the stage for an explosive pop-culture crossover.",
