      "date": "1998-01-23",
      "topic": "film",
      "text": "23 January saw James Cameron's cinematic juggernaut *Titanic* dock in British cinemas, unleashing unprecedented queues at multiplex box offices nationwide. Starring **Leonardo DiCaprio** and **Kate Winslet** as star-crossed lovers aboard the doomed luxury liner, the three-hour disaster romance silenced critics who had predicted an expensive box office catastrophe. Instead, audiences flocked back for repeated viewings, leaving cinema aisles littered with soggy tissues and ushering in an era of unavoidable Celine Dion ballads.",
      "wiki": "Titanic (1997 film)",
