      "date": "1998-01-26",
      "topic": "politics",
      "text": "26 January saw US President **Bill Clinton** forcefully deny allegations of an extramarital affair with former White House intern Monica Lewinsky during a televised press conference. Wagging his index finger firmly toward reporters, Clinton famously declared that he did not have sexual relations with that woman. Political analysts marvelled at the sheer bravado of the performance, oblivious to the fact that linguistic gymnastics over the definition of the word \"is\" would soon dominate global news headlines for months.",
