      "date": "1998-02-09",
      "topic": "music",
      "text": "9 February saw punk collective **Chumbawamba** inject anarchy into the 18th Brit Awards when vocalist Danbert Nobacon dumped an ice bucket over Deputy Prime Minister **John Prescott**. Protesting New Labour's cozy courting of the \"Cool Britannia\" music establishment, Nobacon dashed to the politician's VIP table at the London Arena and drenched his impeccably tailored suit in freezing water. Prescott's team loudly condemned the attack as cowardly and contemptible, while the band cheerfully expressed surprise that anyone took award shows so seriously.",
      "wiki": "1998 Brit Awards",
