      "topic": "wrestling",
      "text": "15 February saw the WWF roll into Houston for *No Way Out of Texas*, headlined by an unsanctioned eight-man brawl that tore down the ringside barriers. With WWF Champion Shawn Michaels sidelined by severe spinal injuries, Savio Vega stepped in alongside Triple H and the **New Age Outlaws** to battle **\"Stone Cold\" Steve Austin**, Owen Hart, Cactus Jack and Chainsaw Charlie. Austin sealed victory by delivering a thunderous Stone Cold Stunner to Road Dogg, cementing his status as the unstoppable fan favourite heading into Boston.",
      "wiki": "No Way Out of Texas: In Your House",
