      "text": "4 September saw quiz show phenomenon *Who Wants to Be a Millionaire?* debut on **ITV**, hosted with theatrical suspense by **Chris Tarrant**. Featuring heart-thumping electronic music, dramatic spotlight lighting, and lifeline options like \"Phone a Friend\" and \"Ask the Audience\", the show had the entire British nation glued to their living-room sofas screaming answers at the screen. The format proved an immediate global goldmine, swiftly licensed to dozens of international broadcasters and establishing the phrase \"Is that your final answer?\" into common parlance.",
